Subject: [PATCH] 008-add-bounded-v2-output-codec

Add an isolated output parser and serializer with bounded canonical encodings and independent corpus tests. Align its C++ API with lotus::v2 and keep checks active in Release builds. It is not wired into inherited ABC consensus or the V2 transaction format yet.

Original review commits: 8415c525377021775dc81bbd9c931165544b05b3 and 68213c58f3a34fc189d64ff4e524af5d8a0dfef4
